@baseUrl = http://localhost:7070

### Hent alle digte
GET http://localhost:7070/poem
Accept: application/json

### Opret et digt
POST http://localhost:7070/poem
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "Aften",
  "author": "Fabian",
  "content": "Solen synker ned\nHavet hvisker mod en sten\nNatten folder sig"
}

### Hent ét digt
GET http://localhost:7070/poem/1
Accept: application/json

### Hent et digt, som ikke findes
GET http://localhost:7070/poem/999999
Accept: application/json

### Opdater et digt
PUT http://localhost:7070/poem/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Stille aften",
  "author": "Fabian",
  "content": "Solen synker ned\nHavet hvisker mod en sten\nNatten folder sig"
}

### Slet digtet
DELETE http://localhost:7070/poem/1

### Kontrollér, at digtet er slettet
GET http://localhost:7070/poem/1
Accept: application/json

@baseUrl = http://localhost:7070

### 1. A Word
POST {{baseUrl}}/poem
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "A Word",
  "author": "Emily Dickinson",
  "content": "A word is dead\nWhen it is said,\n  Some say.\nI say it just\nBegins to live\n  That day."
}

### 2. Life's Trades
POST {{baseUrl}}/poem
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Life's Trades",
  "author": "Emily Dickinson",
  "content": "It's such a little thing to weep,\n  So short a thing to sigh;\nAnd yet by trades the size of these\n  We men and women die!"
}

### 3. A Syllable
POST {{baseUrl}}/poem
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "A Syllable",
  "author": "Emily Dickinson",
  "content": "Could mortal lip divine\n  The undeveloped freight\nOf a delivered syllable,\n  'T would crumble with the weight."
}

### 4. Friends
POST {{baseUrl}}/poem
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Friends",
  "author": "Emily Dickinson",
  "content": "Are friends delight or pain?\n  Could bounty but remain\nRiches were good.\n\nBut if they only stay\nBolder to fly away,\n  Riches are sad."
}

### 5. Philosophy
POST {{baseUrl}}/poem
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Philosophy",
  "author": "Emily Dickinson",
  "content": "It might be easier\n  To fail with land in sight,\nThan gain my blue peninsula\n  To perish of delight."
}

### Hent alle digte
GET {{baseUrl}}/poem
Accept: application/json